        "rodillera_testimonios": {
          "type": "custom_liquid",
          "name": "Prueba social",
          "settings": {
            "custom_liquid": "<div class=\"testimonials-carousel-wrapper\"><div class=\"testimonials-container\"><div class=\"testimonial-card\"><div class=\"testimonial-main-layout\"><div class=\"testimonial-image\"><img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0741/8072/2856/files/4_optimized.jpg?v=1772406794\" alt=\"Cliente\"></div><div class=\"testimonial-body-content\"><div class=\"testimonial-stars\">★★★★★</div><p class=\"testimonial-text\">\"Llevaba más de un año con dolor en la rodilla izquierda. A los 8 días de usarla bajó la inflamación notablemente. No pensé que algo así pudiera funcionar tan rápido.\"</p><div class=\"testimonial-footer\"><span class=\"verified-icon\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\"><path d=\"M10.2426 16.3137L6 12.071L7.41421 10.6568L10.2426 13.4853L15.8995 7.8284L17.3137 9.24264L10.2426 16.3137Z\" fill=\"#3E84F4\"/><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" clip-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M12 21C16.9706 21 21 16.9706 21 12C21 7.02944 16.9706 3 12 3C7.02944 3 3 7.02944 3 12C3 16.9706 7.02944 21 12 21ZM12 23C18.0751 23 23 18.0751 23 12C23 5.92487 18.0751 1 12 1C5.92487 1 1 5.92487 1 12C1 18.0751 5.92487 23 12 23Z\" fill=\"#3E84F4\"/></svg></span><span class=\"client-info\"><strong>Carmen L.</strong> (Bogotá) 🇨🇴</span></div></div></div></div><div class=\"testimonial-card\"><div class=\"testimonial-main-layout\"><div class=\"testimonial-image\"><img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0741/8072/2856/files/1_optimized.jpg?v=1772406794\" alt=\"Cliente\"></div><div class=\"testimonial-body-content\"><div class=\"testimonial-stars\">★★★★★</div><p class=\"testimonial-text\">\"Me lesioné jugando fútbol y el médico me recomendó calor para la recuperación. La compré sin esperanzas y superó todo. El calor penetra profundo y alivia de verdad.\"</p><div class=\"testimonial-footer\"><span class=\"verified-icon\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\"><path d=\"M10.2426 16.3137L6 12.071L7.41421 10.6568L10.2426 13.4853L15.8995 7.8284L17.3137 9.24264L10.2426 16.3137Z\" fill=\"#3E84F4\"/><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" clip-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M12 21C16.9706 21 21 16.9706 21 12C21 7.02944 16.9706 3 12 3C7.02944 3 3 7.02944 3 12C3 16.9706 7.02944 21 12 21ZM12 23C18.0751 23 23 18.0751 23 12C23 5.92487 18.0751 1 12 1C5.92487 1 1 5.92487 1 12C1 18.0751 5.92487 23 12 23Z\" fill=\"#3E84F4\"/></svg></span><span class=\"client-info\"><strong>Rodrigo V.</strong> (Medellín) 🇨🇴</span></div></div></div></div><div class=\"testimonial-card\"><div class=\"testimonial-main-layout\"><div class=\"testimonial-image\"><img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0741/8072/2856/files/2_optimized.jpg?v=1772406794\" alt=\"Cliente\"></div><div class=\"testimonial-body-content\"><div class=\"testimonial-stars\">★★★★★</div><p class=\"testimonial-text\">\"Trabajo 10 horas de pie y al final del día las rodillas me mataban. Desde que uso la rodillera por las noches duermo mucho mejor y el dolor ya no es lo que era. 100% recomendada.\"</p><div class=\"testimonial-footer\"><span class=\"verified-icon\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\"><path d=\"M10.2426 16.3137L6 12.071L7.41421 10.6568L10.2426 13.4853L15.8995 7.8284L17.3137 9.24264L10.2426 16.3137Z\" fill=\"#3E84F4\"/><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" clip-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M12 21C16.9706 21 21 16.9706 21 12C21 7.02944 16.9706 3 12 3C7.02944 3 3 7.02944 3 12C3 16.9706 7.02944 21 12 21ZM12 23C18.0751 23 23 18.0751 23 12C23 5.92487 18.0751 1 12 1C5.92487 1 1 5.92487 1 12C1 18.0751 5.92487 23 12 23Z\" fill=\"#3E84F4\"/></svg></span><span class=\"client-info\"><strong>Martha P.</strong> (Cali) 🇨🇴</span></div></div></div></div><div class=\"testimonial-card\"><div class=\"testimonial-main-layout\"><div class=\"testimonial-image\"><img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0741/8072/2856/files/3_optimized.jpg?v=1772406794\" alt=\"Cliente\"></div><div class=\"testimonial-body-content\"><div class=\"testimonial-stars\">★★★★</div><p class=\"testimonial-text\">\"Llegó rápido a Barranquilla y el pago contra entrega me dio mucha confianza. La garantía de 15 días me convenció de probarla. Llevo 3 semanas usándola y no la cambio.\"</p><div class=\"testimonial-footer\"><span class=\"verified-icon\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\"><path d=\"M10.2426 16.3137L6 12.071L7.41421 10.6568L10.2426 13.4853L15.8995 7.8284L17.3137 9.24264L10.2426 16.3137Z\" fill=\"#3E84F4\"/><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" clip-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M12 21C16.9706 21 21 16.9706 21 12C21 7.02944 16.9706 3 12 3C7.02944 3 3 7.02944 3 12C3 16.9706 7.02944 21 12 21ZM12 23C18.0751 23 23 18.0751 23 12C23 5.92487 18.0751 1 12 1C5.92487 1 1 5.92487 1 12C1 18.0751 5.92487 23 12 23Z\" fill=\"#3E84F4\"/></svg></span><span class=\"client-info\"><strong>Jorge A.</strong> (Barranquilla) 🇨🇴</span></div></div></div></div></div></div><style>.testimonials-carousel-wrapper{width:100%;overflow:hidden;padding:0;margin:0;}.testimonials-container{display:flex;overflow-x:auto;scroll-snap-type:x mandatory;gap:12px;padding:5px 15px;scrollbar-width:none;-webkit-overflow-scrolling:touch;}.testimonials-container::-webkit-scrollbar{display:none;}.testimonial-card{flex:0 0 88%;scroll-snap-align:center;background:#fff;border:1px solid #f0f0f0;border-radius:10px;padding:14px;box-sizing:border-box;box-shadow:0 2px 6px rgba(0,0,0,.03);}.testimonial-main-layout{display:flex;align-items:flex-start;gap:12px;}.testimonial-image img{width:50px;height:50px;border-radius:50%;object-fit:cover;flex-shrink:0;}.testimonial-body-content{flex:1;min-width:0;}.testimonial-stars{font-size:.9rem;margin-bottom:4px;color:#FFD700;}.testimonial-text{margin:0;font-size:1.3rem;line-height:1.3;color:#333;word-break:break-word;}.testimonial-footer{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:5px;margin-top:10px;padding-top:8px;border-top:1px solid #f5f5f5;}.verified-icon svg{width:15px;height:15px;}.client-info{font-size:1.1rem;color:#666;}@media(min-width:768px){.testimonial-card{flex:0 0 350px;}.testimonials-container{justify-content:center;}}</style>"
